text cf_src_om2 "om2\ntext hdr \"OM2:ok:144\\n\"\nfn mix a uint b uint to uint inline\nret add rotr a 1 b\nend\nfn sumv v view uchar * to ulong\ns = ulong 0\nfor i ulong len v\ns = add s ulong get v i\nend\nret s\nend\nfn fill e edit uchar * to void\nfor i ulong 8 unroll\nput e i uchar add mul i 2 0x0a\nend\nend\nfn main to int\nbuf = new uchar 12 0\nfill part buf 2 8\nif ne sumv view part buf 2 8 136\nret 1\nend\nif ne mix uint 0x10 uint 0x04 uint 0x0c\nret 2\nend\nr = write 1 hdr 0 len hdr\nret 0\nend\n"
